-4f53-886d-853aaf450670","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"自分はシステム環境設定のユーザとグループでデフォルトシェル書き換えたことしかなかったです","ts":"1615282006.006900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ocP"}]},{"client_msg_id":"250b7130-3ae5-4a22-b14e-8dc3de74d35f","type":"message","user":"U81LLJ340","text":"ですです","ts":"1615281974.006500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+WneE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e754288e-c801-4f7d-bf12-f46c970a5db2","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"あ、Alacrittyってそこ設定できるんですね","ts":"1615281958.006200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"BjJ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1481c727-921e-42f8-98cd-5c90db239380","type":"message","user":"U81LLJ340","text":"えーと、CPUによって(brewで入れた)シェルの指定パスが違うことになるので、そこを書き換えてやる感じです","ts":"1615281937.005900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"b5LWY"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a30ca1ba-f2f4-446a-80c6-dfbba3943782","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"`~/.config/alacritty/alacritty.yml`","ts":"1615281895.005200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"snup"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9c29a238-29c8-48c3-90eb-e21214394c16","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"指定して、どっちもoptに入れれるようにする、というのはありなのかな?","ts":"1615281882.004800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"mbohh"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3d646e45-33bb-45ff-b408-381cd429b98f","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"Alacrittyの設定ファイルって.config以下に置くのとは別の話ですか？","ts":"1615281874.004700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"LJQm"}]},{"client_msg_id":"096ab78e-6b02-4804-9898-2d994d585716","type":"message"